[background arg="res://icon.svg" fade="0.0"]
Welcome to our humble little town!
Lots of tourists have been arriving.
We need your help
With the increase in tourists, we need to either cap tourist limits and lose out on profit or let them all stay
- Cap
	set {Tourist_Cap_Stay.cap} = true
	set {score} += 1.0
- Stay
	set {Tourist_Cap_Stay.stay} = true
	set {score} -= 1.0